    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silly's Gameshow is a co-op horror game where you and your friend are trapped in a room together with only a flashlight and 2 doors to defend yourself. Team up to complete 10 challenges for a reward, while surviving against animatronics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op: Play with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animatronics: There are animatronics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles: Solve Difficult puzzles using teamwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ads: This game includes advertisements from some of your favorite companies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items: Earn cosmetics and collect items as you progress.</p></li></ul>",
